          {
            "author": {
              "__typename": "User",
              "login": "simpleqt"
            },
            "body": "Thanks - and you're right, this is a duplicate. #55226 (\"Ignore token stream intervals for pooling\", merged 2026-10-20) fixes the same `missing-detokenizer` path in `vllm/v1/engine/output_processor.py`, so there is nothing left here to review. Closing it rather than leaving two versions of the same one-line fix in the queue.\n\nFor the record, in case it is ever useful: this one simply skipped the stream-interval buffering block when `self.detokenizer is None` (pooling requests are built without a detokenizer) instead of restructuring the condition around it - behaviourally the same outcome as what merged.\n\nIf any pooling request still asserts with `--stream-interval > 1` on current `main`, ping me and I will reopen this against `main` rather than open anything new.\n",
